<title>UK: TBI buys London properties for 19.4 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TBI buys London properties for 19.4 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property investment firm TBI Plc said on Monday it exchanged contracts with Hampton Trust to buy London-area properties for 19.4 million stg in cash.</p>
</text>
